  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing Comprehensive Water Management Plans for Indian Cities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective is to develop a framework for comprehensive Water Management plan for cities, develop a model Water Balance and Water Action plan, digitalisation, and developing capacity building blocks for other cities. This will directly contribute to the vision of the Green Strategic Partnership, the Letter of Intent between Denmark and Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs (signed on 5th July 2021) and the sustainability agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
